# Windows-only Control Centre GUI + packaging (Sprint 6 policy: local-only,
# never pushed — see HANDOFF.md). Everything under local_windows/ is
# Windows-machine-specific GUI source, PyInstaller config, and build output.
local_windows/
*.spec
!native/macos/*.spec
WatchClank*.exe

# Native launcher build products
native/macos/build/
native/macos/dist/
native/macos/generated/
